_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet","html_url":"https://github.com/xhocquet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-25T22:31:54Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T22:32:18Z","body":"Confirmed the issue on latest commit https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/d5edd4a59287679ae390149c0c1c3397aeb5f502\n\nReverting https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/7d2ca2d8ac49cde9767e00b70f9eaf1920eb266d fixes the error in the MRP. After reverting I was not able to reproduce the original bug that it was supposed to fix: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/88796\n\nLogically it seems like using the `p_path` is preferable since it includes import and other details, whereas `p_original_path` does not. Would recommend reverting https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/7d2ca2d8ac49cde9767e00b70f9eaf1920eb266d unless there's something else I'm missing","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797338678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3798267913","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105299#issuecomment-3798267913","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105299","id":3798267913,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iZPgJ","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T07:45:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T07:45:36Z","body":"> After reverting I was not able to reproduce the original bug that it was supposed to fix\n\nPlease note that this bug only appears after exporting the project in binary token mode. Also, the bug appears due to cache discrepancies, where the same script is present in the cache under different file paths (`gdc` after exporting the project and `gd` when accessed from other scripts).\n\n> Logically it seems like using the `p_path` is preferable since it includes import and other details, whereas `p_original_path` does not.\n\nWe initially tried to fix this by canonicalizing file paths, but then came to the conclusion that the cache should always contain the original path, not the actual path.\n\nI would say that what the author is trying to do is unsupported in the first place; you can see that the `gd` and `gdc` extensions are hardcoded in many places. But we should probably at least support this use case on a best-effort basis.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3798267913/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]